      "text": "One continuous eight-second cinematic shot starting exactly from this supplied illustration. A gigantic four-armed Aevos throws the large blue-brown planet from his upper hand on screen-left into the party's blue shield. The camera is LOCKED in its initial wide view behind the heroes for the ENTIRE shot. No camera orbit, push-in, pan or cut. Keep every hero facing AWAY from the camera toward Aevos for all eight seconds. Mira is the brown-haired woman with the ring staff in the center-left. Her back stays toward the camera. Her head, neck, shoulders, torso and hips remain naturally aligned in ONE direction toward the boss. Her normal human neck never twists sideways or backward, and her face never turns toward the camera. She keeps her initial upright silhouette, one normal head, two arms and two legs. She grips the ring staff with her right hand while the left hand projects the barrier. Her head and body move together as a single anatomically correct figure. 0 to 2 seconds: Aevos winds up his planet-bearing arm. The five companions firmly brace without changing pose. 2 to 4 seconds: Aevos swings forward and RELEASES the planet. His hand becomes empty. The huge round world clearly flies downward toward the party, continents and clouds visible, growing nearer. 4 to 6 seconds: The world hits the blue dome in front of the heroes. Brilliant blue-gold shockwave and flying debris. The dome bends and cracks, but keeps the heroes protected and visible through the light. Mira remains planted, bending BOTH knees only slightly, her spine straight, neck aligned with shoulders, still facing Aevos. 6 to 8 seconds: Dust settles. All companions hold their original defensive orientation toward Aevos. Nobody spins, turns their head backward, falls, changes sides, steps backward or walks. Arin keeps his cyan sword and kite shield, Orin his huge rectangular shield, red mechanical Zara protects ONE normal four-legged golden-white dog Milo. Long silver-haired Kael remains at far right. Stable bodies, equipment and faces throughout, no duplicated or fused limbs. Powerful cosmic scale and force, faithfully detailed painted fantasy illustration. Deep windup rumble, rushing planet, thunderous impact, ringing shield and falling debris. No voices, captions, words, music or logos."
    },
